      "widgets_values": [
        "【简短要求】改成黑红配色的轻纱款式，保留精致金色饰品\n\nEdit <image_1>. <image_1> is the target character reference (Feiyue), and <image_2> is the clothing reference only. Strictly preserve the exact same person from <image_1>: keep the exact face, facial features, expression, hairstyle, hair ornaments, body proportions, and pose. ONLY replace the outfit/clothing on the character in <image_1> with the clothing shown in <image_2>. Completely ignore any person, face, hairstyle, pose, or background in <image_2>. Style requirement: preserve the Chinese-fantasy painterly illustration style of <image_1>, rich brushwork, refined semi-painterly shading and ornate textures. Additional user instruction: 改成黑红配色的轻纱款式，保留精致金色饰品. Background requirement: replace the entire background with a completely flat, uniform, solid pure chroma-key green screen (#00FF00, RGB 0,255,0). No shadows, no gradients, no floor, no props, no studio lighting falloff, no scenery, clean crisp character edges against pure #00FF00 green.",
        "scenery, room, outdoor, sky, floor, shadow on background, gradient background, white background, grey background, dark background, blurry, deformed face, wrong character",
